@page "/stats"
@* #350: interactive because this page shows database-derived numbers, and while the database is
   degraded they came from a schema this build cannot vouch for. The banner below says so and carries
   the repair, rather than leaving an operator to read those figures as fact. *@
@rendermode InteractiveServer

<PageTitle>@Text.StatsHeading — Quotinator</PageTitle>

<h1>@Text.StatsHeading</h1>
<p class="text-muted">@Text.StatsDescription</p>

<DegradedDatabaseBanner />

<DatabaseStatsSummary />
